  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Removed ungenerated `R1` and `EM-0600-4FL` from `sample_job()` in `crates/app/tests/shared_face_bodies_finish.rs`.\n- Asserted `gate.skipped` and `gate.not_judged` are absent, zero gouge problems appear, `gate.ok == true`, and `S1` reports its genuine `shank_hit` collision (`ok == false`, `held_by == [\"S1\"]`) across all six Z-bands.\n- Added `push_support_dir` and `push_shallow_edge_supports` (`cos_min^3` ellipse curvature bound, `MAX_CHORD = 0.006` mm, and `theta = 0` crossings) in `crates/motion/src/finishing3d/scan.rs`.\n- Extracted `crates/motion/src/finishing3d/rings_overhang.rs` (`ColumnLaw`, `overhang_column_clear`, `bisect_column_edge`, `trim_blocked_columns`) and wired `emit_rings_with_trim` in `crates/motion/src/finishing3d/rings.rs` to split and trim 3-axis ring runs under overhangs and tight walls (`wall_lim = col_strict` when `tolerance <= 0.05`, `r - tolerance` otherwise).\n- Capped `eps_chord` at `0.005` mm in `raster_pass_spaced` and passed `trim_columns = false` from `swarf` and `swarf_multi` in `crates/motion/src/finishing3d/raster.rs`.\n- Added three regression pins in `crates/motion/tests/finish3d_overhang_and_chord.rs`.\n- Added the decision record in `docs/decisions/1840-finish-verify-gate.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\n- Keeping ungenerated `R1` caused `verify` to skip simulation and return an empty problem list (`worst 12.69 mm` gouge hidden across four bands).\n- Coarse XY direction spacing on shallow-Z edges skipped tangency points along wall slices, creating chord gouges (`0.1479 mm` in the fixture pin).\n- Ring levels only checked `column_clear` at a closed cycle's entry vertex, letting open-air entries walk under overhanging canopies (`dist 2.6701 < 2.9900`) and steep-wall V-notches (`2.9878 < 2.995` on Band 5, `0.34 mm` vertical column gouge).\n- `eps_chord = p.tolerance * 0.25` (`0.0125 mm` at `0.05` tolerance) with midpoint-only subdivision allowed off-center convex ridges to sag `0.011113 mm > DEV_TOL` (`0.01 mm`).\n\n## Tests\n\nPins:\n- `cargo test --release -p camcraft-app --test shared_face_bodies_finish -- --include-ignored`: 8 passed, 0 failed (Bands 1-6 generate, verify runs with zero gouges, and `shank_hit` holds post).\n- `cargo test --release -p camcraft-motion --test finish3d_overhang_and_chord`: 3 passed, 0 failed (`shallow_wall_edge_slice_keeps_tie_endpoints_and_ellipse_chord_within_gouge_tol`, `waterline_and_steep_rings_trim_segments_under_overhang_instead_of_cutting_through`, `parallel_raster_over_convex_cylinder_keeps_sagitta_within_stock_sim_dev_tol`).\n\nMutations:\n- `scan.rs` (`push_shallow_edge_supports` reverted to `upstream/main`): `shallow_wall_edge_slice_...` fails (`rings: 2 ring entries refused - their plunge column from the approach plane crosses the solid...`), then passes 3/3 when restored.\n- `rings.rs` / `rings_overhang.rs` (disabled `trim_columns` guard): `waterline_and_steep_rings_...` fails (`Waterline move 17 ... cut into overhang: dist=2.6701 < 2.9900`), then passes 3/3 when restored.\n- `raster.rs` (reverted `eps_chord` `.min(0.005)` cap): `parallel_raster_over_convex_cylinder_...` fails (`cells=4, max_gouge=0.011113 mm`), then passes 3/3 when restored.\n\nRegression and lint runs after final code changes:\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` (run with `CAMCRAFT_NO_SCCACHE=1 RUSTC_WRAPPER=` because host `sccache` timed out): 2 step(s), 0 failed (14.5 min; `camcraft-motion` lib + 12 suites and `camcraft-app` 7 suites).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: 0 warnings, 0 errors.\n- `cargo test --release -p camcraft-motion --test finish3d -- --include-ignored`: 88 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test --release -p camcraft-motion --test swarf_pose_continuity`: 6 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test --release -p camcraft-app --test golden_cl`: 33 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test --release -p camcraft-app --test setup_align_3d`: 6 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test --release -p camcraft-app --test shared_face_bodies`: 5 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test --release -p camcraft-app --test wall_column_gouge`: 3 passed, 0 failed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- `cargo xtask gate release` (full UI pixel snapshots and crates outside `camcraft-motion` / `camcraft-app`).\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- `#1713` (`feat(finish3d): gap_link - a straight link across gap openings`) touches `crates/motion/src/finishing3d/raster.rs` (serpentine piece-reversal lines inside `raster_pass_spaced`, different hunk/lines from our `eps_chord` cap and `rings_and_tail_with_trim` / `swarf` / `swarf_multi`); whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nEffort: max\nChangelog: Fix 3D Finish shallow-edge, overhang-trim, and convex-chord gouges and enable full verify gate coverage on the imported sample\nFixes #1840\n",
